Subject: Wait for local proxy completion before agent tests finish
Origin: DHI-internal (upstream test synchronization)
Description: Move proxy completion logging into test cleanup so the test remains active until the subprocess exits.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/google/inverting-proxy.git 6264998ae706281fd068e8f3eeb3cbd42046c5b6
Verify: test agent/agent_test.go::TestHTTP2Backend
Forwarded: no (local package build stabilization pending upstream submission)
Drop-When: never: pinned upstream source lacks synchronized proxy process cleanup

The proxy subprocess exits asynchronously after its context is cancelled. Waiting from test cleanup prevents its
completion log from using testing.T after the enclosing agent test has already completed.

